    "reason": "GPU budget. The dispatch cap was 25 GPU-h; billed node occupancy reached 20.66 GPU-h after 5 cells (compute 14.39 GPU-h; the gap is straggler idle, see cost_accounting). mbpp_c128 was killed after 30/378 items and is NOT graded.",
    "why_the_verdict_is_unaffected": "K1 compares Scaffold against the BEST non-oracle canvas, i.e. a max over settings. Both benchmarks already satisfy the <=5.0 pp clause at canvas=32 (HE+ -3.64 pp, MBPP+ -0.05 pp). Adding further canvas settings can only raise the max, so it can only keep K1 fired -- it cannot unfire it. Oracle cells are excluded from the K1 decision by invariant 4.",
